				"README.md": {
					"diff": "--- published/README.md\n+++ rebuilt/README.md\n@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@\n }\n ```\n \n-Or you need to specify both. As ReactCrop is based on percentages you will need to know the ratio of the image. If you don't then see [onImageLoaded](https://github.com/DominicTobias/react-image-crop#onimageloadedimage-optional) for how to set your crop in there.\n+Or you need to specify both. As ReactCrop is based on percentages you will need to know the ratio of the image. If you don't know it then see [onImageLoaded](https://github.com/DominicTobias/react-image-crop#onimageloadedimage-optional) for instructions on how to set your crop in there.\n \n #### minWidth (optional)\n \n",
